            "review_title": "Review at Cham Banh Mi",
            "review_text": "Cameron R\n2 contributions\n0\nOk\nJun 2017 • Family\nThe service was friendly and prompt. The menu was fairly western oriented with only a few traditional Vietnamese dishes. The beef mince with spaghetti was an odd tasting number, they added a sweet BBQ sauce, lol. Still, the food was decent quality. Good if you are freaking out over eating Vietnamese food.\nWritten June 19, 2017",
