            "review_title": "Review at Cham Banh Mi",
            "review_text": "pr7169\nCastro Valley, California275 contributions\n0\nUpscale Dining\nFeb 2017 • Solo\nThe Cham Banh Mi was a nice find, right off the street and across from my hotel (The Minh Chau). Good menu options, well-prepared food, and good service at a decent price. Beer and wine also available. \n\nThe waiter did not speak English, and I accidentally ordered two dinners. She must have thought I was crazy, though I ate them both because the food was so good -- and I was hungry after a long flight. Point being, the food is really good!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 20, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
